    bounds: [445, 352, 32, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 12, bold: true, color: "$sage", align: [right, middle], text: P1}
  - elementId: m2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 395, 390, 154]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        栖山苑 9 层 242 间；首层 10 间隐藏，232 间公开测试单间
        真实资料待补；未知租金／面积／地址不填 0 或虚构
        全体 admin 直接受理／改期／取消／履约；不分配、不排班
        本机草稿≠物业受理；支付商户不是前置

  # 当前证据与缺口
  - elementId: gap-tick
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 587, 5, 28]
    viewBox: [5, 28]
    points: "2.5,0 2.5,28"
    border: {style: solid, width: 5, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: gap-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 582, 340, 36]
    content:
